	(text "U1: car rail below 10.06 V -> EN_BOOST; releases above ~10.6 V.\nNo cell lockout (removed in v1.1): its ~50 us filter shut the boost off on inrush and transmit sag,\nand a single primary cell needs no protection from running flat."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
